  "type": "Other",
  "role": "PDFDocumentView",
  "subrole": "UIView",
  "value": "PDF CONVERTER\nGet started with a new experience of PDF!\nPDF Converter helps you read, convert, edit, and understand documents on your\nphone. Use this sample file to explore what the app can do.\nTap the + button at the bottom to import photos, scan documents, convert files, or\ntransfer from your computer.\nRead All Document\nOpen PDF, Word, Excel, PPT \u2014 fast and seamless\nOpen PDF, Word, Excel, and PowerPoint files in one place. Preview them instantly and\nconvert between formats whenever you need.\nConvert Your Files\nSelect any Word, Excel, PowerPoint, or PDF file. PDF Converter converts between\nformats in seconds.\nPDF \u2192 Word, Excel, PowerPoint\nWord \u2192 PDF\nExcel \u2192 PDF\nPDF \u2192 Markdown, CSV\nEdit PDFs Like a Pro\nHighlight, annotate, sign, and mark up PDFs easily with PDF Converter.\nHighlight, Underline, Draw, Note, Sign\nUnderstand & Manage PDFs\nTranslate and summarize files with AI. Use powerful tools to manage documents\nefficiently.\nAI PDF \u2014 Ask questions, summarize, and understand any document instantly.\nScan PDF \u2014 Scan and digitize paper documents with your phone camera.\nImage to PDF \u2014 Select a picture, convert, and save as PDF.\nSign & Lock PDF \u2014 Sign documents and protect them with a password.\nTap the + button at the bottom to import photos, scan documents, convert files, or\ntransfer from your computer.",
